flowchart TD
  CME[CME / COMEX feeds] --> AD[Provider adapters]
  KRAKEN[Kraken public data] --> AD
  AD --> INST[Instrument registry + contract resolver]
  INST --> CAN[Canonical market store / replay]
  CAN --> FEAT[Causal feature snapshots]
  FEAT --> TECH[Technical / structure / momentum]
  FEAT --> MICRO[Microstructure research]
  FEAT --> QLIB[Qlib research worker]
  TECH --> FUSE[AMI evidence fusion]
  MICRO --> FUSE
  QLIB --> FUSE
  FUSE --> PROP[Strategy decision proposal]
  PROP --> RISK[AMI independent risk authority]
  RISK -->|Paper authorization only| OMS[AMI paper OMS]
  OMS --> LEDGER[Paper fills / positions / P&L / audit ledger]
  CAN -. read-only .-> UI[Unified workstation]
  FUSE -. read-only .-> UI
  RISK -. read-only .-> UI
  LEDGER -. read-only .-> UI
